# Φ-alchemy machines

- Heat: use `PhiHeat` / `PhiHeatSource` / `HeatLevel` — do not hardcode burner neighbor loops in new consumers.
- Recipes: prefer datapack tags (`pestles`, `mortar_inputs`, `burner_catalysts`, `alembic_*`); keep MVP potion matrix in `AlembicRecipes` until JEI/datapack recipes exist.
- Menus: register in `ModMenus`, screens via `RegisterMenuScreensEvent`; open with `ServerPlayer.openMenu(be, buf -> buf.writeBlockPos(pos))`.
- See `docs/ALCHEMY_MACHINES.md` for player-facing flow and deferred content.
